      <title>Foundation model for particle collision data analysis</title>
      <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s42256-026-01322-9</link>
      <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Machine Intelligence, Published online: 29 October 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s42256-026-01322-9"&gt;doi:10.1038/s42256-026-01322-9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Hsu et al. present EVENET, a foundation model pretrained on simulated particle collisions using both self-supervised learning and physics labels, which transfers across many analysis tasks and works on real collider data.</content:encoded>
